  "content": "[Intro]\n[Dm]  [Am]  [Cm]\n[Dm]\n\n[Verse 1]\n[Dm]Deadly as the viper\n[Bb]Peering from its coil The\n[Am]poison there is coming to the bo-\n[Dm]il\nTicking like a time bomb The\n[Bb]fuse is running short\n[Am]on the verge of snapping if it's caught\n[Dm]\n\n[Chorus]\n[C]And all the [C#dim]pressure that's been buil-\n[Dm]ding up\n[C]For all the years [C#dim]it bore the load\n[Dm]\n[C]The cracks appear, [C#dim]the frame starts\n[Dm]to [Bb][Am]distort [G]It`s\n[Am]ready to explode\nJaw-\n\n[Bridge]\n[Dm]breaker\n[C]\n\n[Verse 2]\n[Dm]Crouching in the corner\n[Bb]Wound up as a spring\n[Am]Piercing eyes that flash are shimmer-\n[Dm]ing\nMuscles`re all contorted\n[Bb]Claws dug in the dirt\n[Am]Every ounce of fiber on al-\n[Dm]ert\n\n[Chorus]\n[C]And all the [C#dim]pressure that's been buil-\n[Dm]ding up\n[C]For all the years [C#dim]it bore the load\n[Dm]\n[C]The cracks appear, [C#dim]the frame starts\n[Dm]to [Bb][Am]distort [G]It`s\n[Am]ready to explode\nJaw-\n\n[Bridge]\n[Dm]breaker\n(Breaker)\n[C]\n[G]\n\n[Pre-Solo]\n[Am]\n\n[Solo 1]\n[Em]\n\n[Solo 2]\n[Am]  [F]\n[Gbm]  [G]  [Amaj7]\n[Am]  [F]\n[G]  [C]  [Bm7]\n[Am]  [F]\n[Gbm]  [G]  [Amaj7]\n[Am]  [F]\n[G]  [C]  [Bm7]\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\n[Em]  [F]  [Gbm]  [G]  [Amaj7]\n[Am]  [Bb]  [Bm7]  [C]  [Dbm7]\n[B]\n\n[Chorus]\n[C]And all the [C#dim]pressure that's been buil-\n[Dm]ding up\n[C]For all the years [C#dim]it bore the load\n[Dm]\n[C]The cracks appear, [C#dim]the frame starts\n[Dm]to [Bb][Am]distort [G]It`s\n[Am]ready to explode\nJaw-\n\n[Outro]\n[Dm]breaker\nJaw-\nbreaker\n[C]Jaw-\n[Dm]breaker\nJaw-\nbreaker\n[C]\n[G]  [Am]  [C]\n[Dm]",
